# SDK Agent Training

This repository stores prompt cases, expected outputs, and recorded runs for testing the `agent_scaffold` skills bundled with [`mainsequence-sdk`](/Users/jose/code/MainSequenceClientSide/mainsequence-sdk/README.md).

The structure separates three concerns:

- `cases/`: the stable training and evaluation corpus
- `snapshots/`: versioned snapshots of the SDK skill bundle being tested
- `runs/`: model outputs grouped by SDK version, agent, and model

## Layout

```text
SdkAgentTraining/
├── cases/
│   ├── general/
│   └── skills/
├── docs/
├── reports/
├── runs/
│   └── sdk/<sdk-version>/<agent>/<model>/<timestamp>/
├── scripts/
└── snapshots/
    └── sdk/<sdk-version>/agent_scaffold/
```

## Setup

```bash
uv sync
uv run python scripts/populate_training_skills.py --sdk-root ../mainsequence-sdk
```

The local dependency is declared through `tool.uv.sources`, so this repo tracks the sibling checkout at `../mainsequence-sdk`.

## Workflow

1. Populate or refresh the skill catalog from the SDK bundle.
2. Add prompt cases under `cases/general/` or `cases/skills/<skill-path>/cases/`.
3. Create a versioned run folder before executing agents.
4. Store outputs and evaluation artifacts inside the run folder.

## Useful commands

```bash
uv run python scripts/populate_training_skills.py --sdk-root ../mainsequence-sdk
uv run python scripts/create_run.py --agent codex --model gpt-5.4 --sdk-root ../mainsequence-sdk
```

See [docs/conventions.md](/Users/jose/code/MainSequenceClientSide/SdkAgentTraining/docs/conventions.md) for the case and run format, and [docs/sdk-cli-notes.md](/Users/jose/code/MainSequenceClientSide/SdkAgentTraining/docs/sdk-cli-notes.md) for the CLI findings that drove this scaffold.
